+        /// </para>
+        /// <para>
+        /// A picture holds premultiplied colours with correct coverage (<see cref="Page.ContentBlending"/>), and is drawn as such, its
+        /// colour scaled with its alpha too when it fades. So pages look exactly like the drawables would, also when semi-transparent
